* store(key,value)
* get(key)
* replication

You learn:

* networking
* storage
* consistency

---

## Project 2: Chat System

Architecture:

```
User

 |
Server

 |
Message Queue

 |
Database
```

Learn:

* real-time communication
* message delivery

---

## Project 3: Distributed Cache

Build:

```
Client

 |
Cache Nodes

 |
Database
```

Learn:

* partitioning
* eviction
* consistency

